[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3669493827","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-3669493827","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":3669493827,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7auAhD","user":{"login":"Sinowa-Programming","id":67034864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDM0ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67034864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming","html_url":"https://github.com/Sinowa-Programming","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T10:09:17Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T10:09:17Z","body":"I can confirm that there is a performance hit.\nGodot v4.5.stable and Godot v4.6.beta (08e6cd181) - Pop!_OS 22.04 LTS on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030 (nvidia; 580.82.09) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-3770 CPU @ 3.40GHz (8 threads) - 15.53 GiB memory\n\nHowever, this may not be a bug, as the MRP provided will load instantly if you space out the spawned CharacterBody2Ds.\nFrom my profiling, it appears that the physics server solves collisions for the 3000 overlapping CharacterBody2Ds.\nThis explains why you see the large speedup when disabling collisions; It does not need to solve the item against the other 3000 colliders that perfectly overlap.\nAs for the StaticBodies, they are passive and do not check for collisions themselves.\n\n[cs2d_disabled_performance_boost_with_spacing.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24232868/cs2d_disabled_performance_boost_with_spacing.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3669493827/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3669527844","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-3669527844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":3669527844,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7auI0k","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T10:15:49Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T10:15:49Z","body":"Good observation, I don't think many many overlapping bodies can be considered a reasonable setup or expected to not cause weirdness in general, is there any reason for this scene being this way?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3669527844/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3672182456","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-3672182456","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":3672182456,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7a4Q64","user":{"login":"Sinowa-Programming","id":67034864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDM0ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67034864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming","html_url":"https://github.com/Sinowa-Programming","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T20:55:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T20:55:32Z","body":"At least in the MRP, I don't see any reason why they would have the scene setup this way. Do you have many overlapping objects all on the same collision layer @Rinkton ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3672182456/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675959176","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-3675959176","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":3675959176,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bGq-I","user":{"login":"Rinkton","id":57531521,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTMxNTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57531521?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton","html_url":"https://github.com/Rinkton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T17:41:10Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T17:41:10Z","body":"Initially this observation was done when I was trying to fix the loading time for my game. The game is packed with many-many blocks(I was experimenting with 500 ones), they are CharacterBody2D (yeah, making them StaticBody2D might solve the problem as well), that are collide[ with each other often on loading(Just went with idea that maybe not they specifically, but the areas, that tracking the neighbours of each concrete block).\n\nSo doing this trick improved loading time from 17s to 9s (saves like 8s) on my machine.\n\nStill, although your assumptions are reasonable, however it's strange for me that after enabling them simultaneously the game don't get freezed for 8s, because they're still colliding and all these should be handled the same way, I thought","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675959176/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676009511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-3676009511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":3676009511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bG3Qn","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T18:00:45Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T18:00:45Z","body":"The loading step does a lot of other things and set up a lot of things with physics so it's not guaranteed to behave the same\n\nBut in real world cases this is very unlikely to ever happen and having so many overlapping bodies will cause other performance issues","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676009511/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678637264","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-3678637264","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":3678637264,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bQ4zQ","user":{"login":"Rinkton","id":57531521,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTMxNTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57531521?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton","html_url":"https://github.com/Rinkton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rinkton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T09:34:47Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T09:34:47Z","body":"Ok, if it might have some side-effects then maybe it can be left as it is. But for the game I'm working on it improves the loading time without any drawbacks noticed, so I still consider it as a good possible optimization.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678637264/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3685886131","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-3685886131","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":3685886131,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bsiiz","user":{"login":"Sinowa-Programming","id":67034864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDM0ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67034864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming","html_url":"https://github.com/Sinowa-Programming","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sinowa-Programming/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T09:22:01Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T09:39:07Z","body":"Your advice is currently sound because there appears to be a bug in the code.\n\nWhen the collision is enabled from the editor, it calls `GodotCollisionObject2D::_update_shapes()` which sets up the collision object's `shape_aabb`. The same function is called again in `GodotPhysicsServer2D::step()` and grows the same `shape_aabb` by 2.5%. This growth causes the item to be inserted into `BVH_Manager::changed_items` when `move()` is called.\n`GodotStep2D::step()` then calls `GodotSpace2D::update()`, and all of the collision shapes in `BVH_Manager::changed_items` will be checked against each other (all 3000).\n\nWhen the collision is enabled through `call_deferred()`, there is no 2nd `GodotCollisionObject2D::_update_shapes()` call, avoiding the `shape_aabb` growth, causing `BVH_Manager::changed_items` to stay empty. With `BVH_Manager::changed_items` empty, there is no costly recheck.\n\nJust to help visualize the problem, here’s a quick and dirty solution(that most likely breaks something else):\n- Comment out `shape_aabb.grow_by((s.aabb_cache.size.x + s.aabb_cache.size.y) * 0.5 * 0.05);` in `GodotCollisionObject2D::_update_shapes`\n\nThis dirty workaround works because the second `GodotCollisionObject2D::_update_shapes()` call won't expand the existing shape_aabb, which prevents it from failing the check: `expanded_aabb_encloses_not_shrink(leaf_aabb, p_aabb)`, in `BVH_Tree::item_move()`.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_collision_object_2d.cpp#L160C1-L185C2","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3685886131/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4792398810","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-4792398810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":4792398810,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHaYz2g","user":{"login":"solodeveloping","id":155950383,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUudLw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155950383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping","html_url":"https://github.com/solodeveloping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T18:23:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T18:23:45Z","body":"In my 3D scene, the shapes are also like this (generated by Godot, the asset had a lot of overdraw), but there is one StaticBody3D (there is another StaticBody3D at the bottom for the box)\n\n<img width=\"510\" height=\"404\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a269df60-51f2-4a51-922e-e0c5926ef64b\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4792398810/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4792420215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-4792420215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":4792420215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHaaHdw","user":{"login":"solodeveloping","id":155950383,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUudLw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155950383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping","html_url":"https://github.com/solodeveloping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T18:26:38Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T18:26:38Z","body":"If I hid the body with the many collision shapes, directly in the box scene, the performance are back to \"normal\" (and keep the Area3D and the box StaticBody3D)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4792420215/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4792432844","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-4792432844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":4792432844,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHaa4zA","user":{"login":"solodeveloping","id":155950383,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUudLw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155950383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping","html_url":"https://github.com/solodeveloping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T18:28:22Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T18:34:03Z","body":"In my case, there are only 25 colliders that overlap, with max 32 points (and the cubes don't overlap with each other, I just increased the distance separating them for a test, still the same)\n\nBut if the script does 25 * 25 checks, it might be bad (or is it 25!)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4792432844/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4792567463","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113867#issuecomment-4792567463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113867","id":4792567463,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHajGpw","user":{"login":"solodeveloping","id":155950383,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUudLw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155950383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping","html_url":"https://github.com/solodeveloping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T18:46:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T18:46:29Z","body":"I think it's the number of collision shapes that matter, and maybe the type, because if they don't overlap, it's the same, for me, I guess the script does not know if it overlaps untils it check for it, something like this","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4792567463/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]